### Upload
PUT http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/catalog/ErrorFilesSet('56f7f156-d897-45f4-b340-2e704d5f104e')/ErrorPayloadFile/$value
Content-Type: text/csv
PayloadFileName: samplexml.csv
MIMEType:text/csv

 < ./files/samplexml.csv
